        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lise Roel, Hugo Höstrup\n- Places: Randers, Denmark, western Sweden, southern Sweden, Randers Municipality, Central Denmark Region, Jutland peninsula\n- Roles: architects\n\nFacts:\n- Lise Roel was born in 1928.\n- Hugo Höstrup was born in 1928 and died in 2004.\n- Lise Roel and Hugo Höstrup were architects born in Randers, Denmark.\n- Lise Roel and Hugo Höstrup had their primary activity and production around 1960 to 1980 in western and southern Sweden.\n- Randers is a city in Randers Municipality in the Central Denmark Region on the Jutland peninsula.",
